style-textlint-status = External textlint unavailable ({ $detail })
style-hint-ai-phrase = Describe the subject and its role concretely.
style-hint-long-sentence = Split independent claims into separate sentences.
style-hint-repeated-ending = Vary sentence structure to reflect the role of each sentence.
style-hint-comma-density = Reorganize the list or split the sentence.
style-hint-rhetorical-negation = State the main claim directly where the contrast is optional.
style-hint-hedging = Express the degree of uncertainty once.
style-hint-no-mix-dearu-desumasu = Use a consistent polite or plain register.
style-hint-ja-no-mixed-period = Match the Japanese sentence-ending punctuation used in this deck.
style-hint-max-kanji-continuous-len = Break up the compound when a shorter or clearer expression is available.
style-hint-no-doubled-joshi = Review repeated particles and separate clauses if needed.
style-hint-no-double-negative-ja = Express the claim directly and preserve its degree of certainty.
style-hint-ja-no-weak-phrase = Name the uncertainty or state the claim directly.
style-hint-ja-no-redundant-expression = Remove the words that add no meaning.
style-hint-max-comma = Split the sentence or turn the enumeration into a list.
style-hint-no-exclamation-question-mark = Use the prose punctuation appropriate to the sentence.
style-hint-no-hankaku-kana = Use full-width katakana.
